{"unit_id":"CHENJIAMIAN__dsh-session-switch#card-zh","repo":"CHENJIAMIAN/dsh-session-switch","commit":"044c2c7782c9ee31a7ba1208858eec4450a5fb06","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"会话快速切换是面向 DSH 桌面端的快捷键插件，在 DSH 快捷键服务中注册命令，默认用 Ctrl+Tab 在当前会话与上一个会话间往返切换。它追踪主视图会话，并在上一个会话不可用时选择最近更新的其他会话，同时跳过空白或已归档会话。适合需要在两个近期对话间快速往返的用户；不需要 API 密钥或外部服务。","source":"generated","evidence":["package.json:40-51","cordis.patch.yml:6-9","client.js:127-161","client.js:245-279"]}
{"unit_id":"CHENJIAMIAN__dsh-session-switch#card-en","repo":"CHENJIAMIAN/dsh-session-switch","commit":"044c2c7782c9ee31a7ba1208858eec4450a5fb06","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"Session Quick Switch is a DSH desktop shortcut plugin. It registers a command so Ctrl+Tab toggles between the current and previous session. If that session is unavailable, it opens the most recently updated other session, skipping blank or archived sessions. It needs no API key or external service.","source":"generated","evidence":["package.json:40-51","cordis.patch.yml:6-9","client.js:127-161","client.js:245-279"]}
