{"unit_id":"CHENJIAMIAN__dsh-session-switch#feature-1","repo":"CHENJIAMIAN/dsh-session-switch","commit":"044c2c7782c9ee31a7ba1208858eec4450a5fb06","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"会话快速切换的功能「切回上一个会话」：触发已注册的快捷键命令后，插件打开上一个仍可用的会话；若其已归档或不存在，则改选最近更新的其他会话。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:180-196","client.js:204-219"]}
