{"unit_id":"CHENJIAMIAN__dsh-session-switch#caveat-1","repo":"CHENJIAMIAN/dsh-session-switch","commit":"044c2c7782c9ee31a7ba1208858eec4450a5fb06","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"会话快速切换使用前须知：默认 Ctrl+Tab 仅为 Windows 桌面声明；macOS、Linux 和浏览器环境受系统或浏览器保留键限制，需自行改绑快捷键。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:269-275"]}
